      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "Directions: For this part you are allowed 30 minutes to write an essay that begins with the sentence \"To increase the likelihood of success, one should set realistic goals and work persistently towards them.\" You can make comments, cite examples or use your personal experiences to develop your essay. You should write at least 150 words but no more than 200 words.",
