    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "5. A) Provide medical service to the community. C) Obtain a doctoral degree in internal medicine.\nB) Make healthcare in her hometown the best. D) Have a profound impact on people around her.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        1032,
