    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "7. A) It is a key medical branch conducive to realizing her dreams.\nB) It connects many other specialties with its broad coverage.\nC) It has a long history in the man's prestigious institution.\nD) It is a medical branch both of her parents specialize in.",
